        "id": 1128369
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-06-03T02:17:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As we have 4 interrupts (attach \u0026 detach on each port) clubbed in a single line we cannot rely on the VBUS/VCC status alone as we need to update VBUS status to charge manager.\n\nYes, second approach you suggested looks good. We can save some memory also. I can take it up in a separate CL.",
